  "description": "With our 2026 MISFIT 12″ we’ve made moving from a balance bike to a pedal bike easier than ever by lightening up the frame and fork, dialing in the handlebar and crank dimensions and adding an easier to pedal 23T sprocket. Small diameter handle grips and a short reach brake lever help keep young riders in control. Low tension U-brake springs and a linear brake cable make slowing down easier while domed axle nuts and stem bolts eliminate sharp edges for those occasional mishaps. Quick-release seat clamp allows seat height adjustments on the fly, while curved valve stems make airing up the 12″ tires easier. With two colorways to choose from each with their own graphic style we’ve got a first pedal bike perfect for your little MISFIT.",
